### 19. Register buyer user
POST {{host}}/api/v1/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "firstName": "Ben",
  "lastName": "Buyer",
  "birthDate": "1996-08-20",
  "email": "buyer-{{$timestamp}}@markethub.test",
  "password": "{{buyerPassword}}"
}

> {%
